WEBVTT

NOTE Wisik-flirt C02 — script-synchronised captions; line placed above takeaway bar.

00:00:04.645 --> 00:00:08.140 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
1 m³. Passen daarin duizend kubieke
centimeters?

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:13.943 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Kijk eerst naar de blokjes waarmee we
meten: 1 cm breed, hoog en diep.

00:00:13.973 --> 00:00:16.444 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
De grote bak is 100 cm breed.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.717 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Er passen dus honderd blokjes naast
elkaar.

00:00:19.747 --> 00:00:21.891 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Hij is ook 100 cm diep.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:25.757 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Eén laag bevat daardoor 100 × 100 blokjes:
10.000.

00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:28.532 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Maar de bak is nog niet vol.

00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:30.241 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Hij is 100 cm hoog.

00:00:30.271 --> 00:00:33.680 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Er passen honderd van zulke lagen op
elkaar.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:37.073 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Honderd keer 10.000 is 1.000.000.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:39.996 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
1 m³ bevat dus 1.000.000 kubieke
centimeters.

00:00:40.026 --> 00:00:44.756 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Bij inhoud doet elke richting mee: lengte,
breedte én hoogte.

00:00:44.786 --> 00:00:48.858 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Alleen naar één rij of één laag kijken is
niet genoeg.
